# cleanup-report.md — Template definition (cleanup report)

## Expression

- Auditable process: scan list + cleanup results + change list
- Every change traceable (original path → disposition → reason)
- Results take effect after user confirmation

## Section hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Cleanup report

### H2 (required)
- Scan list table: id / original path / type / suggested disposition
- Cleanup results table: original path / disposition (keep / archive / delete) / reason
- Reclassification table: original path / new path / category

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional sections

- [optional] User confirmation record: item / date
- [optional] Changelog: date / change
